fic UI patterns.\"</p>\n          <div class=\"author\"><strong>Marco Cornacchia</strong>, Figma</div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Duplicated for seamless loop -->\n        <div class=\"testimonial-card\">\n          <p class=\"quote\">\"ScreenVault is a great resource and it always comes in handy to see what the best practices or standards are for mobile patterns in our current landscape.\"</p>\n          <div class=\"author\"><strong>Sebastian Speier</strong>, Shop</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"testimonial-card\">\n          <p class=\"quote\">\"ScreenVault is a game-changer for designers looking to step up their understanding of UX and UI design patterns. It's indispensable in the modern designer's toolbox.\"</p>\n          <div class=\"author\"><strong>Meng To</strong>, DesignCode</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"testimonial-card\">\n          <p class=\"quote\">\"ScreenVault is one of my favorite resources for product design and UI inspo. I love having access to a ton of 'real world examples' to see how companies handle specific UI patterns.\"</p>\n          <div class=\"author\"><strong>Marco Cornacchia</strong>, Figma</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n      <div class=\"marquee marquee-reverse\">\n        <!-- Row 2 -->\n        <div class=\"testimonial-card\">\n          <p class=\"quote\">\"ScreenVault has quickly become our favourite inspiration resource for designing mobile apps at endless.design, their advanced filtering is unmatched in the inspiration space.\"</p>\n          <div class=\"author\"><strong>Daryl Ginn</strong>, Endless</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"testimonial-card\">\n          <p class=\"quote\">\"ScreenVault is my go-to reference for app & web design. Apart from saving countless hours, it gives me insights on the design patterns of world-class products. A must-have!\"</p>\n          <div class=\"author\"><strong>Rachel How</strong></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"testimonial-card\">\n          <p class=\"quote\">\"By using the ScreenVault app, I save both my research time and space in my photo galleries filled with random screenshots. It is a wonderful design tool you cannot live without!\"</p>\n          <div class=\"author\"><strong>Haerin Song</strong>, Visa</div>\n        </div>\n        <!-- Duplicated for seamless loop -->\n        <div class=\"testimonial-card\">\n          <p class=\"quote\">\"ScreenVault has quickly become our favourite inspiration resource for designing mobile apps at endless.design, their advanced filtering is unmatched in the inspiration space.\"</p>\n          <div class=\"author\"><strong>Daryl Ginn</strong>, Endless</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"testimonial-card\">\n          <p class=\"quote\">\"ScreenVault is my go-to reference for app & web design. Apart from saving countless hours, it gives me insights on the design patterns of world-class products. A must-have!\"</p>\n          <div class=\"author\"><strong>Rachel How</strong></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"testimonial-card\">\n          <p class=\"quote\">\"By using the ScreenVault app, I save both my research time and space in my photo galleries filled with random screenshots. It is a wonderful design tool you cannot live without!\"</p>\n          <div class=\"author\"><strong>Haerin Song</strong>, Visa</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- CTA Section -->\n  <section class=\"cta text-center bg-surface\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <h2>Never run out of inspiration again.</h2>\n      <p class=\"large\" style=\"max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto;\">Use ScreenVault for free as long as you like or get full access with any of our paid plans.</p>\n      <div class=\"cta-actions mt-4\">\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\">Join for free</a>\n        <a href=\"#\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-lg\">See our plans</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"app-icons-marquees\">\n      <div class=\"icon-marquee\">\n        <!-- 20 mock icons duplicated -->\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n        <!-- duplicates -->\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"icon-marquee reverse\">\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n        <!-- duplicates -->\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n        <div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div><div class=\"app-icon\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- Footer -->\n  <footer class=\"footer\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <div class=\"footer-grid\">\n        <div class=\"footer-brand\">\n          <div class=\"logo\">\n            <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"var(--accent)\"><path d=\"M12 2L2 22h20L12 2z\"/></svg>\n            ScreenVault\n          </div>\n          <p>Design better digital experiences with ScreenVault.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer-links\">\n          <h4>Explore</h4>\n          <ul>\n            <li><a href=\"#\">Glossary</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#\">Pricing</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#\">Changelog</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#\">Blog</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#\">Colors</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer-links\">\n          <h4>Contact</h4>\n          <ul>\n            <li><a href=\"#\">Help center</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#\">Careers</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#\">Merch</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#\">Support</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer-links\">\n          <h4>Social</h4>\n          <ul>\n            <li><a href=\"#\">X (Twitter)</a></li>\n            <li><a href=\"#\">LinkedIn</a></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"footer-bottom\">\n        <div>© ScreenVault 2018–2026. All rights reserved</div>\n        <div style=\"display:flex; gap:16px;\">\n          <a href=\"#\">Privacy Policy</a>\n          <a href=\"#\">Terms</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <script>\n    // Interaction: Stats Counter\n    const statsSection = document.getElementById('stats-section');\n    const counters = document.querySelectorAll('.counter');\n    const speed = 100;\n\n    const animateCounters = (entries, observer) => {\n      entries.forEach(entry => {\n        if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n          counters.forEach(counter => {\n            const target = +counter.getAttribute('data-target');\n            let current = 0;\n            const inc = target / speed;\n\n            const updateCount = () => {\n              current += inc;\n              if (current < target) {\n                counter.innerText = Math.ceil(current).toLocaleString();\n                requestAnimationFrame(updateCount);\n              } else {\n                counter.innerText = target.toLocaleString();\n              }\n            };\n            updateCount();\n          });\n          observer.unobserve(entry.target);\n        }\n      });\n    };\n\n    if (statsSection) {\n      const observer = new IntersectionObserver(animateCounters, { threshold: 0.5 });\n      observer.observe(statsSection);\n    }\n\n    // Interaction: Search Tabs & Filters\n    const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.tab');\n    const pills = document.querySelectorAll('.pill');\n    const searchGrid = document.getElementById('search-results');\n\n    function refreshSearchGrid() {\n      searchGrid.style.opacity = 0;\n      searchGrid.style.transform = 'translateY(10px)';\n      \n      setTimeout(() => {\n        searchGrid.style.opacity = 1;\n        searchGrid.style.transform = 'translateY(0)';\n      }, 200);\n    }\n\n    tabs.forEach(tab => {\n      tab.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        tabs.forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));\n        tab.classList.add('active');\n        refreshSearchGrid();\n      });\n    });\n\n    pills.forEach(pill => {\n      pill.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        pills.forEach(p => p.classList.remove('active'));\n        pill.classList.add('active');\n        refreshSearchGrid();\n      });\n    });\n\n    // Interaction: Flows Toggle\n    const flowToggles = document.querySelectorAll('.toggle-btn');\n    const flowDescVideos = document.getElementById('flow-desc-videos');\n    const flowDescPrototype = document.getElementById('flow-desc-prototype');\n    const flowVisualContainer = document.getElementById('flow-visual-container');\n\n    flowToggles.forEach(btn => {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        flowToggles.forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));\n        btn.classList.add('active');\n        \n        // Simple fade out\n        flowVisualContainer.style.opacity = 0;\n        \n        setTimeout(() => {\n          if (btn.dataset.flow === 'videos') {\n            flowDescVideos.classList.remove('hidden');\n            flowDescPrototype.classList.add('hidden');\n            flowVisualContainer.innerHTML = `\n              <div class=\"mock-video\">\n                <div class=\"play-btn\">\n                  <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            `;\n          } else {\n            flowDescVideos.classList.add('hidden');\n            flowDescPrototype.classList.remove('hidden');\n            flowVisualContainer.innerHTML = `\n              <div class=\"mock-prototype\">\n                <div class=\"proto-screen\"><div class=\"proto-connector\"></div></div>\n                <div class=\"proto-screen\"><div class=\"proto-connector\"></div></div>\n                <div class=\"proto-screen\"></div>\n              </div>\n            `;\n          }\n          flowVisualContainer.style.opacity = 1;\n        }, 200);\n      });\n    });\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>",
